Facility Capacity is part of Data Center Control Plane (DCCP), Tranche 2:
Facility Capacity and Placement. It is repository 9 of the 72-runtime DCCP
corpus and owns the aggregate, generation-bound facility-capacity model that
composes space, rack, power, cooling, operational-reserve and facility-service
evidence into one authoritative answer.

Third-party notices
-------------------

This product includes no third-party source code and links no third-party
libraries. It is implemented against the C++20 standard library and the
operating-system interfaces it needs for durable atomic file replacement,
file flushing and advisory file locking.

The canonical serialization format, the integrity digest (SHA-256, FIPS 180-4)
and every identity, generation, epoch and quantity type are implemented in this
repository.

Facility Capacity does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All state,
snapshots and evidence are written to local files chosen by the operator and
never leave the machine running the software.
